cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "puuwaawaa-sdm: structured decision making optimizer for Puʻuwaʻawaʻa Forest Reserve"
abstract: >-
  Integer-programming optimizer, figure and table scripts, and sensitivity
  and fire-feedback analyses for a structured decision making study at
  Puʻuwaʻawaʻa Forest Reserve, Hawaiʻi, that selects one of 10 management
  alternatives for each of 22 paddocks, together with a reserve-wide roadside
  fuelbreak, under seven weighting scenarios and five budget levels.
  Includes a Paddock 9 structural sensitivity that frees the fixed
  restoration commitment under three specifications of conservation value.
type: software
